---

---

<section
  class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-2xl p-6 border border-outline-variant/40 shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-4"
>
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <div
        class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-primary"
      >
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">smartphone</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-on-surface">
        Simulación del Asistente en WhatsApp
      </h2>
    </div>
    <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary-container animate-ping"></span>
  </div>

  <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant">
    Así interactuará tu bot con los clientes en cuanto confirmes la conexión:
  </p>

  <div
    class="rounded-2xl border-4 border-surface-container-high bg-[#ece5dd] overflow-hidden shadow-inner flex flex-col"
  >
    <div class="bg-[#075e54] text-white p-3 flex items-center justify-between">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">arrow_back</span>
        <div
          class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-white/20 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs"
        >
          ☕
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col leading-tight">
          <span class="font-semibold text-xs text-white">Main Street Cafe</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-white/80">En línea (Agente IA)</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-white/80">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">videocam</span>
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">call</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="p-4 flex flex-col gap-3 bg-[#ece5dd] min-h-[200px]">
      <div
        class="self-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/60 text-on-surface-variant text-[10px] font-medium"
      >
        Hoy
      </div>

      <div
        class="self-end bg-[#dcf8c6] text-[#1f2937] p-2.5 rounded-xl rounded-tr-none max-w-[85%] shadow-xs text-xs"
      >
        <p>¡Hola! ¿Tienen tarta de pistacho para pedir hoy? 🍰</p>
        <div
          class="flex items-center justify-end gap-1 mt-1 text-[9px] text-[#1f2937]/60"
        >
          <span>14:32</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[12px] text-primary"
            >done_all</span
          >
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="self-start bg-white text-[#1f2937] p-2.5 rounded-xl rounded-tl-none max-w-[90%] shadow-xs text-xs border border-[#e2d8d2]/60"
      >
        <div
          class="flex items-center gap-1 text-[10px] text-primary font-bold mb-1"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[12px]">smart_toy</span>
          <span>WhatsBot AI · Respuesta inmediata</span>
        </div>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          ¡Hola! 👋 Claro que sí. Puedes pedirla ahora mismo o ver nuestra
          carta:
        </p>
        <button
          class="w-full mt-2 py-1.5 px-3 rounded-lg bg-primary-container text-on-primary font-semibold text-[11px] hover:bg-secondary-container transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-1 shadow-xs"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]"
            >restaurant_menu</span
          >
          <span>Ver Menú y Pedir Online</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div
    class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-xl bg-primary-fixed text-on-primary-fixed text-xs border border-primary-container/20"
  >
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[18px]"
        >bolt</span
      >
      <span class="font-bold"> Tiempo de respuesta promedio: 1.4 segundos</span>
    </div>
    <span class="text-primary font-semibold">24/7 Activo</span>
  </div>
</section>
